zapd
====

This directory is a Rust reimplementation of parts of the Zed Attack Proxy (ZAP)
core that lives in the parent of this directory. It changes the language and the
architecture of that work (Apache License 2.0, section 4).

It is not an official OWASP ZAP build and it is not "ZAP by Checkmarx".
The program name is zapd. "Compatible with the ZAP proxy listener contract" is
a description of behavior, not a trademark claim.

